    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop cute animals into a box, pack as many in as you can, but if two of the same collide they'll merge into a larger animal!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/b93df82022c160d77dbab346d135e963.avif?t=1749839140\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooika is a delightful casual game where you'll encounter a parade of adorable animals! But watch out! These critters aren't happy when they meet their twin, match two animals of the same kind and POP! They'll combine to form a brand new, even larger animal! It's your job to strategically contain them all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.poster.avif?t=1749839140\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.webm?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.mp4?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every critter combined, you'll earn points and build up your score. Zooika is easy to pick up and play, but mastering the art of animal combination will take some strategic thinking. So, are you ready to box in some fun? Get ready for Zooika! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/edc91bb35a586644ac70df3f390a7556.avif?t=1749839140\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different sets of animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple play areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam integrations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.poster.avif?t=1749839140\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.webm?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.mp4?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop cute animals into a box, pack as many in as you can, but if two of the same collide they'll merge into a larger animal!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/b93df82022c160d77dbab346d135e963.avif?t=1749839140\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooika is a delightful casual game where you'll encounter a parade of adorable animals! But watch out! These critters aren't happy when they meet their twin, match two animals of the same kind and POP! They'll combine to form a brand new, even larger animal! It's your job to strategically contain them all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.poster.avif?t=1749839140\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.webm?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/3efd854e50c068fad3f13197ad97ecaf.mp4?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every critter combined, you'll earn points and build up your score. Zooika is easy to pick up and play, but mastering the art of animal combination will take some strategic thinking. So, are you ready to box in some fun? Get ready for Zooika! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/edc91bb35a586644ac70df3f390a7556.avif?t=1749839140\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different sets of animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple play areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam integrations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.poster.avif?t=1749839140\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.webm?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/e63a27069ff86166ecacb7fdd06dbe82.mp4?t=1749839140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
